check-memory-gate: ok e command, GUIX_ENVIRONMENT set: timeout runs Valgrind with ADR-0014's flags and tests/guix-glibc-locpath.supp, then Chez, and a Valgrind that runs nothing fails
check-memory-gate: ok f hangs: a program that never ends is named HUNG
check-memory-gate: ok g none: test-memory refuses to pass with no suite
check-memory-gate: ok h options: test-memory refuses to run with VALGRIND_OPTS set
check-memory-gate: ok h options: test-memory refuses to run with a $HOME/.valgrindrc
