check-memory-gate: ok h options: test-memory refuses to run with any other VALGRIND_ variable set, VALGRIND_LAUNCHER
check-memory-gate: ok h options: a $HOME/.valgrindrc that a suite writes mid-run hides nothing from the next: --command-line-only=yes
